    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Begley are delighted to present No. 17 Watertower Apartments, a bright and well-maintained two-bedroom apartment ideally positioned on the highly sought-after Retreat Road, one of Athlone's most convenient and desirable residential locations.\n\nThis spacious apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, comprising a welcoming entrance hall, an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, two generous double bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a substantial storage room, providing excellent additional space rarely found in apartment living. The property also benefits from gas-fired central heating, ensuring comfort and energy efficiency throughout the year.\n\nThe location is second to none, with an extensive range of amenities just a short walk or drive away. Residents can enjoy easy access to primary and secondary schools, Technological University of the Shannon, supermarkets, cafés, sports clubs, medical facilities, and Athlone Town Centre, making it an ideal home for first-time buyers, investors, or those looking to downsize.\n\nCombining a superb location with spacious accommodation and excellent convenience, No. 17 Watertower Apartments presents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of Athlone's most established residential areas."
      },
